From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sargun Vohra <sargunv@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 23:19:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Carry plugin frame queries

Lets a source-free plugin layer return GeoJSON features with world-pixel
hit envelopes each frame, indexed through the native dynamic feature index
so rendered-feature queries hit them. Not yet proposed upstream.

Carried by maplibre-plugins from maplibre-native-ffi PR #731 until it lands
upstream.
