+`0027-plugin-frame-queries.patch` adds source-free feature snapshots to the
+plugin ABI. Frame queries use the native dynamic feature index and copy the
+plugin's GeoJSON and world-pixel envelopes. This patch is local-only: it is
+not upstreamed, and no upstream PR exists.
+
 Each patch is the squashed diff of its upstream branch, applied on top of the
 patches before it, so a patch that adds a test next to an earlier patch's test
 carries that placement rather than the branch's own context.
